summary: D1123 a formattable conformance's offsets hold in the builder text.format_onto hands it while a value longer than the store is handed on in pieces: text.length counts the bytes handed on, so align_right and align_left find a number whose label was handed on between the offset and the alignment, align_left fills after a piece that was handed on, align_right reports no_space when the piece it would move has been handed on, and truncate cuts what the builder still holds and nothing that went before
